            <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">How to Track Stocks and Mutual Funds in One Place
                (India 2026)</h1>

            <!-- Author Bio & Trust Signals -->
            <div
                style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
